                "a": "(i) Factors of 12 are 1, 2, 3, 4, 6 and 12\nFactors of 18 are 1, 2, 3, 6, 9 and 18\nCommon factors of 12 and 18 are 1, 2, 3 and 6\nHCF = 6\n(ii) Factors of 10 are 1, 2, 5 and 10\nFactors of 15 are 1, 3, 5 and 15\nCommon factors of 10 and 15 are 1 and 5\nHCF = 5\n(iii) Factors of 22 are 1, 2, 11 and 22\nFactors of 44 are 1, 2, 4, 11, 22 and 44\nCommon factors of 22 and 44 are 1, 2, 11 and 22\nHCF = 22\n(iv) Factors of 8 are 1, 2, 4 and 8\nFactors of 32 are 1, 2, 4, 8, 16 and 32\nCommon factors of 8 and 32 are 1, 2, 4 and 8\nHCF = 8\n(v) Factors of 24 are 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 12 and 24\nFactors of 30 are 1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 10, 15 and 30\nFactors of 36 are 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 9, 12, 18 and 36\nCommon factors of 24, 30 and 36 are 1, 2, 3 and 6\nHCF = 6"
