                "a": "(i) 36 = 2 x 2 x 3 x 3\n42 = 2 x 3 x 7\nCommon factors = 2 x 3\nHCF = 2 x 3 = 6\n(ii) 28 = 2 x 2 x 7\n42 = 2 x 3 x 7\nCommon factors = 2 x 7\nHCF = 2 x 7 = 14\n(iii) 45 = 3 x 3 x 5\n75 = 3 x 5 x 5\nCommon factors = 3 x 5\nHCF = 3 x 5 = 15\n(iv) 25 = 5 x 5\n75 = 3 x 5 x 5\nCommon factors = 5 x 5\nHCF = 5 x 5 = 25\n(v) 18 = 2 x 3 x 3\n72 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 3 x 3\nCommon factors = 2 x 3 x 3\nHCF = 2 x 3 x 3 = 18\n(vi) 32 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2\n64 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2\nCommon factors = 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2\nHCF = 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 = 32\n(vii) 60 = 2 x 2 x 3 x 5\n90 = 2 x 3 x 3 x 5\nCommon factors = 2 x 3 x 5\nHCF = 2 x 3 x 5 = 30\n(viii) 25 = 5 x 5\n40 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 5\n50 = 2 x 5 x 5\nCommon factor = 5\nHCF = 5"
