                "a": "(i) Multiples of 25 are 25, 50, 75, 100, 125, ...\nMultiples of 15 are 15, 30, 45, 60, 75, 90, ...\nCommon multiples of 25 and 15 are 75, 150, ...\nLCM = 75\n(ii) Multiples of 12 are 12, 24, 36, 48, 60, 72, 84, 96, ...\nMultiples of 14 are 14, 28, 42, 56, 70, 84, 98, ...\nCommon multiples of 12 and 14 are 84, 168, ...\nLCM = 84\n(iii) Multiples of 10 are 10, 20, 30, 40, ...\nMultiples of 20 are 20, 40, 60, ...\nCommon multiples of 10 and 20 are 20, 40, ...\nLCM = 20\n(iv) Multiples of 6 are 6, 12, 18, 24, ...\nMultiples of 9 are 9, 18, 27, ...\nCommon multiples of 6 and 9 are 18, 36, ...\nLCM = 18\n(v) Multiples of 7 are 7, 14, 21, 28, 35, 42, ...\nMultiples of 5 are 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 30, 35, ...\nCommon multiples of 7 and 5 are 35, 70, ...\nLCM = 35"
