                "a": "(i) 42 = 2 x 3 x 7\n18 = 2 x 3 x 3\nLCM = 2 x 3 x 3 x 7 = 126\n(ii) 15 = 3 x 5\n36 = 2 x 2 x 3 x 3\nLCM = 2 x 2 x 3 x 3 x 5 = 180\n(iii) 12 = 2 x 2 x 3\n45 = 3 x 3 x 5\nLCM = 2 x 2 x 3 x 3 x 5 = 180\n(iv) 35 = 5 x 7\n15 = 3 x 5\nLCM = 3 x 5 x 7 = 105\n(v) 20 = 2 x 2 x 5\n48 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 3\nLCM = 2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 3 x 5 = 240\n(vi) 27 = 3 x 3 x 3\n24 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 3\nLCM = 2 x 2 x 2 x 3 x 3 x 3 = 216\n(vii) 45 = 3 x 3 x 5\n63 = 3 x 3 x 7\nLCM = 3 x 3 x 5 x 7 = 315\n(viii) 30 = 2 x 3 x 5\n18 = 2 x 3 x 3\nLCM = 2 x 3 x 3 x 5 = 90\n(ix) 11 = 11\n22 = 2 x 11\n33 = 3 x 11\nLCM = 2 x 3 x 11 = 66\n(x) 24 = 2 x 2 x 2 x 3\n30 = 2 x 3 x 5\n36 = 2 x 2 x 3 x 3\nLCM = 2 x 2 x 2 x 3 x 3 x 5 = 360"
