                "q": "Mrs. Sayem wants to distribute 45 patties, 60 samosas and 75 juices equally. Find the greatest number of students among which these materials can be distributed equally.",
                "a": "Number of patties = 45\nNumber of samosas = 60\nNumber of juices = 75\n45 = 3 x 3 x 5\n60 = 2 x 2 x 3 x 5\n75 = 3 x 5 x 5\nCommon factors = 3 x 5\nHCF = 3 x 5 = 15\nGreatest number of students = 15\nEach student gets 45 ÷ 15 = 3 patties, 60 ÷ 15 = 4 samosas and 75 ÷ 15 = 5 juices."
