                    "a": "To measure temperature with a laboratory thermometer: put the thermometer in the water so that it does not touch the beaker, keep it there until the temperature becomes constant, keep your eye at the level of the alcohol, and note down the temperature. To measure body temperature with a clinical thermometer: keep it in your partner's mouth very carefully for 1.5 minutes and record the temperature.",
